WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
Write the lesson in one sentence. List

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.200
the shots you need. List the shots

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.980
you need. Charge two camera batteries. Do

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.720
not format the backup card. Record a

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:15.540
short sound check. Leave room for another

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:20.400
take. Leave room for another take. Label

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.080
every source folder. Back up the entire

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:23.600
session.